{"id":"5668","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5668_main_cirrus-floccus-homomutatus_clouds-special-clouds-and-other-features.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>这个高云的形成是由于飞机凝结尾迹的扩散所致。在拍摄本图片时，其宽度已扩大到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">涵盖约22°角</span> （大概为一臂距离处伸出五指所遮挡的天空范围）。各个云素呈圆形（<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span>），且宽度通常大于1°。此云可归类为人为转化絮状卷云。</p>\n<p>一些自然形成的卷云正从西北扩散而来，天空完全覆盖着极薄的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">薄幕卷层云</span>乳白色云纱。因此编码为CH = 7。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© George Anderson","location":"英国，英格兰，沃金厄姆","latitude":"纬度: 51° 25' 4'' N","longitude":"经度: 0° 51' 48'' W","date":"29 February 2016 0921 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向西西南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 7","code":"图像P/S代码: S.1.16","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.1.16"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5668_syn_cirrus-floccus-homomutatus_clouds-special-clouds-and-other-features.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>暖锋向东抵近。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 皇家版权","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/5668_sat_cirrus-floccus-homomutatus_clouds-special-clouds-and-other-features.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>高云在英国英格兰南部上空向东推进。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© EUMETSAT, 2016","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5561_main_development-of-cirrus-uncinus-homomutatus-image-3_clouds-special-clouds-and-other-features.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>这是记录人为转化钩卷云发展的一系列照片的最后一张。云在头顶飘过时拍摄的这张照片比第1张晚31分钟，比第2张晚20分钟。</p>\n<p>图为在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span> 和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>上的卷云丝条，并在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span>和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>以云簇（钩云种）结束。这些<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">云簇</span>是原生凝迹的余迹。随时间的推移，原生飞机凝结尾迹（人为性卷云）导致了人为转化钩卷云的发展。人为转化一词用于表示此类云的人造、或人为的起源。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© George Anderson","location":"英国，英格兰，沃金厄姆","latitude":"纬度: 51° 25' 4'' N","longitude":"经度: 0° 51' 48'' W","date":"25 June 2014 1958 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 1","code":"图像P/S代码: P.1.16","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.1.16"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5562_main_development-of-cirrus-uncinus-homomutatus-image-1_clouds-special-clouds-and-other-features.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>这是记录人为转化钩卷云发展的三张系列照片的第一张。</p>\n<p>图片中<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span>、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>、<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span> 和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>为一些飞机凝结尾迹（人为性卷云）。然而，其主要特征是在照片中沿对角线延伸的更大面积的卷云。这是<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">人为转化卷云</span>，是由于凝迹在西北高空风中扩散而形成。在卷云的下方和左侧可看到<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">原生凝迹</span>，沿对角线向照片<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">右下角</span>延伸。<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">人为转化卷云的丝条</span>从原生凝迹向照片右上方发散。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© George Anderson","location":"英国，英格兰，沃金厄姆","latitude":"纬度: 51° 25' 4'' N","longitude":"经度: 0° 51' 48'' W","date":"25 June 2014 1927 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 1","code":"图像P/S代码: P.1.16","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.1.16"},{"src":"/images/compressed/5563_main_development-of-cirrus-uncinus-homomutatus-image-2_clouds-special-clouds-and-other-features.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc6\"><p>这是记录人为转化钩卷云发展的三张照片中的第二张。它比第一张照片的拍摄时间晚11分钟。</p>\n<p>照片底部，在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">1</span> 和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">2</span>的原生飞机凝结尾迹正在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">3</span> 和<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">4</span>破碎为云簇。通过这些云簇，<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">人为转化卷云</span> 的丝条布满了照片。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© George Anderson","location":"英国，英格兰，沃金厄姆","latitude":"纬度: 51° 25' 4'' N","longitude":"经度: 0° 51' 48'' W","date":"25 June 2014 1938 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北西北","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 1","code":"图像P/S代码: P.1.16","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.1.16"}]}]}